### Launchpad REST API Testing Collection (VS Code REST Client format)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get All Internships (Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/internships?page=1&limit=10
Accept: application/json

### 3. Filter Internships by Domain (Full Stack Development)
GET {{baseUrl}}/internships?domain=Full Stack Development
Accept: application/json

### 4. Filter Internships by Mode (Remote)
GET {{baseUrl}}/internships?mode=Remote
Accept: application/json

### 5. Search Internships by Keyword (e.g. SQL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/internships?search=SQL
Accept: application/json

### 6. Get Single Internship by ID (INT-101)
GET {{baseUrl}}/internships/INT-101
Accept: application/json

### 7. Create a New Internship (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/internships
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "INT-301",
  "title": "Backend Systems Intern",
  "domain": "Full Stack Development",
  "mode": "Remote",
  "location": "India",
  "duration_weeks": 8,
  "openings": 2,
  "skills": ["Node.js", "Express", "SQLite", "Jest"],
  "description": "Build high-throughput REST APIs and design resilient relational databases.",
  "applications_open": 1
}

### 8. Update an Existing Internship (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/internships/INT-301
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Lead Backend Systems Intern",
  "openings": 4
}

### 9. Delete an Internship (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/internships/INT-301
Accept: application/json

### 10. Submit Sample Application (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "internship_id": "INT-101",
  "applicant_name": "Jordan Smith",
  "applicant_email": "jordan.smith@example.com",
  "portfolio_url": "https://github.com/jordansmith",
  "notes": "Excited to contribute to frontend accessibility and design systems!"
}

### 11. Duplicate Application Protection Check (Should return 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "internship_id": "INT-101",
  "applicant_name": "Jordan Smith",
  "applicant_email": "jordan.smith@example.com"
}

### 12. View Applications Audit Log (Safe Masked View)
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications
Accept: application/json
